Open_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not an opener
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller is an opener
    ├── given the contract is halted
    │   └── it should revert
    └── given the contract is not halted
        ├── when the order has expired
        │   └── it should revert
        └── when the order has not expired
            ├── when the market does not exist
            │   └── it should revert
            └── when the market exists
                ├── given the market is disabled
                │   └── it should revert
                └── given the market is enabled
                    ├── given the market is paused
                    │   └── it should revert
                    └── given the market is not paused
                        ├── given the breaker has tripped
                        │   └── it should revert
                        └── given the breaker has not tripped
                            ├── when the position id is zero or used
                            │   └── it should revert
                            └── when the position id is new
                                ├── when the signature is not the user's
                                │   └── it should revert
                                └── when the signature is the user's
                                    ├── when the terms are outside the market's bounds
                                    │   └── it should revert
                                    └── when the terms are inside the market's bounds
                                        ├── when the entry tick is too old or from the future
                                        │   └── it should revert
                                        └── when the entry tick is fresh
                                            ├── when the entry tick is before the order
                                            │   └── it should revert
                                            └── when the entry tick is at or after the order
                                                ├── when the entry price is not positive
                                                │   └── it should revert
                                                └── when the entry price is positive
                                                    ├── when the open gate blocks the bet
                                                    │   └── it should revert
                                                    └── when the open gate lets it in
                                                        ├── when the stake does not arrive in full
                                                        │   └── it should revert
                                                        └── when the stake arrives in full
                                                            ├── it should record the position
                                                            ├── it should hold the stake and its max profit in the books
                                                            ├── it should take exactly the stake from the user
                                                            └── it should emit {PositionOpened}
